# Boot animation cards on the lock page. Never finish a real change (no root helper); cancel any password prompt.
ipc panels settings lock
wait 2
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 20
wait 1
shot boot
note B1 System card with the distro logo, one card per design with its still, None with three text lines, names under them, the chosen one ringed; card size 136 and gap 12, identical in both shells.
ptr move 1100 700 sleep 600 glide 1100 700 100
wait 1
shot boot-hover
note B2 hovering a card that is not chosen: the still is a little lighter (6 percent white), pointer hand. Position is a guess: read card positions from the boot shot.
# Keys
ptr move 700 700 sleep 200 glide 700 700 100 click
wait 1
key -k Tab
wait 1
shot boot-tab
note B3 focus ring moves to the next card (ring on the picture).
key -k space
wait 1
shot boot-busy
note B4 the card shows a dark veil plus a 24 px light spinner (#EDEDEF); compare size and colour with QML. If a password prompt is up, it must be cancelled afterwards.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot boot-cancel
note After cancelling the prompt the veil is gone and the old choice is ringed again.
# MANUAL: cancel the password prompt if one appears (cannot be checked automatically)
ipc panels close
